{"id":227998614600702,"type":"album","name":"Parallelograms","artist":"Linda Perhacs","year":1970,"weight":12,"info":{"cover":"https://cdn2.albumoftheyear.org/600x0/album/12282-parallelograms.jpg","aoty":89,"aoty_user":85,"yt":"jpkFXDXgQ9Y","links":{"rateyourmusic":"https://rateyourmusic.com/release/album/linda-perhacs/parallelograms/","aoty":"https://www.albumoftheyear.org/album/12282-linda-perhacs-parallelograms.php"},"desc":"Parallelograms is an album by American psychedelic folk singer Linda Perhacs. It was produced by Leonard Rosenman. Her first and only album until the release of The Soul of All Natural Things in 2014, it was all but completely ignored when originally released on Kapp Records in 1970. Discouraged by the lack of commercial attention and the label's reluctance to promote the album, Perhacs returned to her career as a dental hygienist. In the 30 or so years that followed, the album gradually developed a cult following. ."},"artist_ref":{"id":247280787448291,"name":"Linda Perhacs","info":{"img":null}},"labels":[],"genres":[{"id":223327500886715,"type":"genre","name":"Contemporary Folk","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":247,"yt":null,"src":"rym"},{"id":200232380703960,"type":"genre","name":"Psychedelic Folk","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":228,"yt":null,"src":"rym"}],"lists":[{"id":42512826448326,"name":"RYM Top — Psychedelia — Psychedelic Folk","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":11,"year":null,"note":null,"total":200,"scaruffi":null},{"id":4780159650629,"name":"Go to sleep. Music to help your insomnia... maybe","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":29,"year":null,"note":null,"total":66,"scaruffi":null},{"id":87310548737747,"name":"RYM Top — Folk — Contemporary Folk","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":80,"year":null,"note":null,"total":200,"scaruffi":null},{"id":94905110718967,"name":"RYM Top — Folk","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":82